  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:17:17",
    "source_sha256": "879cba4c30e69284192e7a2a99961df0c40c084566e20ced40f2911df0b61d24",
    "target": "没错啦！看见前面的卫兵了吗？就在里面。只是……那些卫兵很不友好，都是坏人。想进去，得吃点苦头。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:18:18",
    "source_sha256": "cf342e573370f009e9cd5c787e378f77acc37b8d9deb8c6ca7b9651fc22daffc",
    "target": "这种事，交给我吧！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:19:19",
    "source_sha256": "0f19f3813f95449a12251a537b1f8eba3fb84936b4f6ade451ab67425d0ec7e0",
    "target": "克里斯蒂安！等等！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:20:20",
    "source_sha256": "608a7d0701734daa8d5a7cc864b7b29c41198d288532273fd1730fac131230ca",
    "target": "干什么的？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:21:21",
    "source_sha256": "856aa4da11f8945b43ab08f6f6a6b05c9cc6e269fc47b85ca5e11d98e03947e0",
    "target": "来见你们所长。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:22:22",
    "source_sha256": "d258c60c879c055ce49be73f0c96d0335e78ada02c3737ca6b6327dd84717703",
    "target": "这家伙，疯了吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:23:23",
    "source_sha256": "e21e2ddf7fecbf898fc8fa41e63393e0bae82b094276df14e47c9db9eb216598",
    "target": "别管他，一会儿就走了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:24:24",
    "source_sha256": "376c8fe303d3dc6ab785c9766801ab702dbabe8618ad32c18141931b30f03ef0",
    "target": "干什么啊？突然就这样……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:25:25",
    "source_sha256": "6ad46d948a15fd1a197f6de0228c135143d58eb119d7d01ca5bb6ced16a6eab2",
    "target": "这……这些家伙，竟敢无视我！喂，叫你们那个骗子头子出来！！！被他骗的人，就在这里！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:26:26",
    "source_sha256": "42f6600edee67bb107c102e33353cd208a82b2c3a296ce829df00adcbdeacfb8",
    "target": "克里斯蒂安！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:27:27",
    "source_sha256": "804100cf7b7d15e4749907e35790f567cd30d7057335f6af2d55a8849e495c9a",
    "target": "这小子……竟敢辱骂我们的教主！$n喂！全都出来！这里有个家伙，需要收拾一下！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:28:28",
    "source_sha256": "d5cb037594d94b9b7a71e6834f5240efa6dfd46435f43ba3c9f20d67b44ffbe2",
    "target": "总之，这份航行日志的数据，损毁得很严重……真正想知道的部分，全被抹掉了。$n好不容易，才拿到原件……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:29:29",
    "source_sha256": "6b06a01470ceaea4d72a69f05c7e9d21ee41e06c11cdafaee7714fab44d75ab9",
    "target": "该不会，是毁掉黑匣子数据的那些家伙干的吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:30:30",
    "source_sha256": "fb9c963430df9ef13fbfcf43d92ce1a1df66321b952b6756672ba8080b8da9c3",
    "target": "有这个可能。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:31:31",
    "source_sha256": "50f53342325052e3bccab6b01ec372a1b13204f67723705c7d221aa9bc4f39f2",
    "target": "合同上的签名，也已经被抹掉。根据留下的公章推测，向斯特莱克斯提出委托的人，似乎是佩尔索灵子研究所的所长。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:32:32",
    "source_sha256": "aec5cadb818c694efdc9529d58da4640a1c2fdd297645258c07c42b07e3a9b0d",
    "target": "那么，就是那家伙，擅自委托别人，把我们从光之使者里带出来？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:33:33",
    "source_sha256": "b50b1e0d476c7474fc793f9fc136ba093d2796b08b72e0628eec5936d45e82e4",
    "target": "是的。可偏偏，带我们出来的地点数据没有了。那里应该，就是光之使者所在之处。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:34:34",
    "source_sha256": "cf94a502460447eb95aa5f21ba860317872c3f4646a4c1b40f000d37f74d8395",
    "target": "全被抹掉了？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:35:35",
    "source_sha256": "ec1b56872da3d719538c69f1fa246be507e1fbee3cd74374a296684761accd4f",
    "target": "嗯……这里的委托内容，是将研究资料运往佩尔索灵子研究所。所以，斯特莱克斯把研究资料装上蓝鸟号，正驶向佩尔索。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:36:36",
    "source_sha256": "9e93f9c6b0fa0b13e8331b8d539d9d89c1e7b93c54822aee39cbef31fb8017c6",
    "target": "研究资料……？真让人不舒服，说得好像我们是待解剖的尸体。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:37:37",
    "source_sha256": "dd7eec288225ae963ce665c270d16adfb4d5964abc850abd14caff26fb936469",
    "target": "研究资料啊……有些奇怪。不过，至少目的地明确了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:38:38",
    "source_sha256": "2f1427878689b084a1c609fd409e1a92e36e78fa9e5dbcb8b66f7a1277de423b",
    "target": "是的。这里也写着，灵子研究所的详细地址。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:39:39",
    "source_sha256": "c9852078d372384ddda901f30d5ebb140f1ffed61ff0a4847c2be6871b0dbe7a",
    "target": "那就直接找所长问吧。既然是他擅自委托，把我们从光之使者里弄出来运走，总该知道它在哪里吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:40:40",
    "source_sha256": "f3fef2dcec20b78876e11f2f2ead03909895f85b72f18f0966fffab13a69de54",
    "target": "可他不会轻易回答。$n也许会认出我们，做出什么事。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0362.fpb:text:41:41",
    "source_sha256": "66ff9bc5d4a9c536ca2e22e87ec560420ce6ad56861f034d144585f45df5e648",
    "target": "对，还是尽量谨慎行动。我们有斯特莱克斯公会成员的身份，先假扮成蓝鸟号船员，试探那位所长吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "0602ec206f40702336a13606a21bdf1fcb37253b465b68825ad61d9a29e276b3",
    "target": "明明说……就在这附近。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
