    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:13:13",
    "source_sha256": "3aa604012fb3d17d6649b466c6f39fec66b87255f44ce556a830d29f90c98b1f",
    "target": "是……是吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:14:14",
    "source_sha256": "03f3879bc05403b9efb0a8f82251437dbd061961118e592e9e66f7e63a68e6ac",
    "target": "看吧！我说得没错吧！问路，还是得问当地人！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:15:15",
    "source_sha256": "5fa89869c886da6f3b5212dfcb8d41d5e59a002748edce34f732ff9f8008b44c",
    "target": "奇怪……真的是这里？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:16:16",
    "source_sha256": "879cba4c30e69284192e7a2a99961df0c40c084566e20ced40f2911df0b61d24",
    "target": "没错啦！看见前面的卫兵了吗？就在里面。只是……那些卫兵很不友好，都是坏人。想进去，得吃点苦头。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:17:17",
    "source_sha256": "cf342e573370f009e9cd5c787e378f77acc37b8d9deb8c6ca7b9651fc22daffc",
    "target": "这种事，交给我吧！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:18:18",
    "source_sha256": "0f19f3813f95449a12251a537b1f8eba3fb84936b4f6ade451ab67425d0ec7e0",
    "target": "克里斯蒂安！等等！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:19:19",
    "source_sha256": "608a7d0701734daa8d5a7cc864b7b29c41198d288532273fd1730fac131230ca",
    "target": "干什么的？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:20:20",
    "source_sha256": "856aa4da11f8945b43ab08f6f6a6b05c9cc6e269fc47b85ca5e11d98e03947e0",
    "target": "来见你们所长。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:21:21",
    "source_sha256": "d258c60c879c055ce49be73f0c96d0335e78ada02c3737ca6b6327dd84717703",
    "target": "这家伙，疯了吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:22:22",
