    "target": "别管他，一会儿就走了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:23:23",
    "source_sha256": "376c8fe303d3dc6ab785c9766801ab702dbabe8618ad32c18141931b30f03ef0",
    "target": "干什么啊？突然就这样……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:24:24",
    "source_sha256": "6ad46d948a15fd1a197f6de0228c135143d58eb119d7d01ca5bb6ced16a6eab2",
    "target": "这……这些家伙，竟敢无视我！喂，叫你们那个骗子头子出来！！！被他骗的人，就在这里！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:25:25",
    "source_sha256": "42f6600edee67bb107c102e33353cd208a82b2c3a296ce829df00adcbdeacfb8",
