    "source_sha256": "804100cf7b7d15e4749907e35790f567cd30d7057335f6af2d55a8849e495c9a",
    "target": "这小子……竟敢辱骂我们的教主！$n喂！全都出来！这里有个家伙，需要收拾一下！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:27:28",
    "source_sha256": "0602ec206f40702336a13606a21bdf1fcb37253b465b68825ad61d9a29e276b3",
    "target": "明明说……就在这附近。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:28:29",
    "source_sha256": "923be8a74ad3b7126efd0f81ab8f805f681d1517a47347f904fbb6d14dbe4819",
    "target": "就是这里。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
