    "source_sha256": "fdcff5206ed6350498408072c09b9441a8b576be9f0501fe2a95fa12da300182",
    "target": "说什么呢？没听见刚才那人怎么说的？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:33:34",
    "source_sha256": "ed7ed6c2edf7a6fb123cd02ea2c756b9f77687a7ee401399a1b8cb92f4e970bb",
    "target": "可是，和在机场附近买的地图，方向完全相反啊。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:34:35",
    "source_sha256": "aaf4a1e00836e984f8df271de24ad614f8c0c4af106064a52b616d5adc79460b",
    "target": "好，就利用那些人吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:35:36",
    "source_sha256": "ce45d44e6299e654d0a300b6dcd3d6f947ea3e2aae1f9b4ffcaec7d73bf9f339",
    "target": "要去哪里？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:36:37",
    "source_sha256": "929ced337de35f8d3a5add83b8c2f20a6a13943e0b5e8d92123798e58f148daa",
    "target": "嗯？哎呀……这位小姐竟然飘着？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:37:38",
    "source_sha256": "bb64bc446e8e470eda0b03145ac15ca48b638a5199cd08585fc711dba27149f6",
