    "target": "喂……喂！我们要去佩尔索灵子研究所！",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0367.fpb:text:39:40",
    "source_sha256": "be2fbcbd8dce9abb15f873cfa12f5ee43c615bc444ab098e11f5bd3df9060240",
    "target": "啊，佩尔索灵子研究所？就在这里，这里！",
    "state": "translated"
