  {
    "id": "Fpb/0370.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "88bcb37333fb2874259164a31f64008907694c96c4138861581a573bdba2ccfd",
    "target": "啊，这走廊真他妈难跑。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0370.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "00b18f53e9080a6aa52190a5e50b3f2921569e97c2e99f9fb04083b379b69ed8",
    "target": "我们的人生，就是奔跑……跑起来～～～",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "b8af08bd45641e59c345f0167222f3aa197f5c11dc0fa3fc74a6113447f69a8b",
    "target": "真是的，近卫队副队长，有那么了不起吗？第一天就迟到？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "876e66f065877275c7a79a30f0c0d31d3bb3c21dc066a611febd4a91631275ac",
    "target": "不是已经道歉了吗。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "5260fda9d910accb97497573da05bdc002b00ab326501965d737f48740c59662",
    "target": "到底要说几次，你才肯罢休……烦死人了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "13bf5ef3d6d8c4051af83b6c6a9e6f21dc56e44a8d30b81612185e9f7b72434d",
    "target": "你……你还真是，越说越来劲。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "ce0a4999a4ff4a00a320677a79c616250ca0b0f2ae69f6473e7959d0892573db",
    "target": "把我当什么？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "396f15ac8e8ff0a413a6221fff8ff0f5c4df1efd871b9034b7c4d4fb947942fa",
    "target": "别看这样，我可是第2组副组长。至少，该讲点礼貌吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "5c26b6276b0dadef93bdb488b31854ec602a6edff3655bcc0eb733984e8f06bb",
    "target": "你先讲礼貌，我才会讲。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "d8ac0ff62fe2213265432cc955149097814b17d34b93fbc0cd1c69ee71d1ec9e",
    "target": "连自我介绍都没有，一上来就不停抱怨我迟到。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "8f8eefc253899ce95f3e14e1c54875a3a40dd1d6272171253a3bfb01498d765e",
    "target": "本来想道歉，也全没那个心情了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "3f0f47831425af90402bc972e700144e68cadb8383139c82693873f8f353d11f",
    "target": "是吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "87614246d48a347d5092c34ffb251e6762e7a79d5636c069e49272e7cf75899c",
    "target": "露琪艾尔·切尔西·德斯克拉尔达。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:11:11",
    "source_sha256": "c4cc5ba49675d1fa4a34d925c0b4126eaa387464bf094fddaa77f7eac0412647",
    "target": "施瓦茨·施图尔姆第2组副组长。你是卡林兹·杰尔比南吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:12:12",
    "source_sha256": "f3ae92e8adb74223187593dfd9c05548d9eb862012cd38a090fc112875ed95a4",
    "target": "这次成为第7组组长的那位。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:13:13",
    "source_sha256": "241c01f577e24942f85c56e7ff7c40a678c66977cbb2c42f343ffe6d72d92d04",
    "target": "那么……你就是吉尔伯特总队长的妹妹……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:14:14",
    "source_sha256": "130bb758c44430277d35986e06fc82c590834551a920e788de9988a704205b4d",
    "target": "反正，我是养女。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:15:15",
    "source_sha256": "3a876f26211c6070da57773feeee825a377e2fbfce69df84e893c7bfe2760432",
    "target": "没有血缘关系，别想刻意讨好我。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:16:16",
    "source_sha256": "e592a8ebb51df175b70e0ffdbc9f1ca4331d442fea1b40f1f3a8ab9fbcafe0f3",
    "target": "我也不擅长奉承。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:17:17",
    "source_sha256": "7de7066c82ab7ed7947e34dd26630fd8e511a91707a5fef1dd48e60f4cdc1503",
    "target": "总之，今天遇上的，全是强势的女人。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:18:18",
    "source_sha256": "10c209fa0890fe02c85a8c663ca8e7a37cc766bc5b1b29a0cc61b266f64121d3",
    "target": "（……）",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:19:19",
    "source_sha256": "16ecd47e1a803632ae8949f8bda73f7a5d0ea210933713f1f1be22701b97ba9a",
    "target": "闭嘴，跟着走就行。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:20:20",
    "source_sha256": "6ee0f4829c554b93f4474c24321b2d3c54d99f0c4e256304ac7071b7c893244a",
    "target": "由于拉德琳娜，我像被赶走一样，来到了施瓦茨·施图尔姆。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:21:21",
    "source_sha256": "e06ecdd5f18eb07c769a7b678de1811b47475bdf5ba881cae01eaa5391d18e5e",
    "target": "从一开始，就料到不会受到欢迎。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:22:22",
    "source_sha256": "2e1648c1c2b4ef33496a0c4ee7e25f34294918707508559034d3c17280fcb9f6",
    "target": "我也没什么心思，和他们好好相处。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0375.fpb:text:23:23",
    "source_sha256": "4ba5cc4841ca82e53538a733d3ea0b42a955bc0d7b9404f925fc5fda00849c7b",
    "target": "只是看在赫利俄斯殿下的份上，打算勉强撑下去。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "377b3b7e8aa23f8fff69f135b60ba3a8ac6812568d3aa5c87c6b2577b5fdd143",
    "target": "欢迎，卡林兹组长。赫利俄斯殿下亲自寄来的信，我已经收到。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "798c1547b48b885667d7892fe52bc81e8aac67b3229339b3aec54c1e49957928",
    "target": "也没必要重新问候了吧。我是卡林兹·杰尔比南。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "1d47b755d2eea7d43a0a2dcf8129b7ec68fec902eb15f89f15c7952f0446f8c9",
    "target": "呵呵，果然和传闻一样。听说，你相当无礼。不过，冰之魅影这个称号，在近卫队很有名，连拉德琳娜也认可你的实力……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "e9171d6cfca9950012ab800a0df9f915d5cdaebc2ad167a16534be261e56a1b8",
    "target": "（那个女人……真稀奇。明明擅自把人塞到这里。）",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "e8d2a98bdbce8e025a4bd1e0b1196f570c1d1d758c399abcb4148d21c44dc794",
    "target": "总之，来到这里，大概不怎么愉快吧。你所在的第7组，成立不久，情况也不佳，成员较少。之后会逐渐增加，请好好干。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "888a431d39c3e3b263ec42696aca709fe567b6a16ea873cc8f3d92192e26a788",
    "target": "通过报告，我大致了解了你的能力。比起死板的普通军人，你的思维相当灵活。正因为如此，我才认为，你能指挥第7组。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "ade42a75c4ea254abc0acbc1643e1e80c09f7404db33c048a1d52143ccbfa8dc",
    "target": "随意戏弄别人，说得好听，就是思维灵活啊。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "359ff314eed24de4931f11c6205222fe0ce1ac77757e44d2bc2d3d0e4625b144",
    "target": "咳……在施瓦茨，需要亲自上阵战斗的机会，会比近卫队更多。我期待，你能发挥多少实力。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "0f85a619904506d2f1ea7c4eafe411ade6db1b621ee4a5f214b3b70cb477faee",
    "target": "我也很期待。闷头战斗，正合我的性子。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "1a9abf257ecb1e77c511e991bcb3b2fa480964951d9284a267cd00a13298e77d",
    "target": "你倒很喜欢挖苦人。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "dfc9af3d64dfcc25f885ac3ff2b61e43b6c7d9f32d0747e8f5dca722dbec6762",
    "target": "切尔西，这里是施瓦茨总部，不是你家。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:11:11",
    "source_sha256": "fbf9373ad16c2e3ead1d3904e4bdcd7c6ea8c2288dce689f68ddb2c5ce86772f",
    "target": "我知道，哥哥。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:12:12",
    "source_sha256": "a9f9e019d070be9e61dde74a14ea2f676bd36126b19acb4aebf52fa16034d24f",
    "target": "希望，你能叫我总队长。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:13:13",
    "source_sha256": "e9470f5740772562046e78f8b3524cde652bdb2383fcf29039cbd979fcd999c1",
    "target": "明白了，总、队、长、大、人。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:14:14",
    "source_sha256": "e55db71a538bb0447eb5a88b4f5d7e1b266cc10bc75b8b7d166ebe57637d395b",
    "target": "那么，请把卡林兹组长，介绍给第7组的其他成员。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:15:15",
    "source_sha256": "9e239a47f193632d5263eda7bc9c82a55112ecb8a57818c65a3decf4a0108262",
    "target": "是，总、队、长、大、人。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0381.fpb:text:16:16",
    "source_sha256": "6f8562011c2c082667a711257359bd1125e2c89d3e10eea99d3d859e3b0a29bb",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0406.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "d1185602f4c184aecca3b7c3050cec6d1e7eb881c6b93d74b779d0fd27b06d85",
    "target": "平安结束，真好。虽然如预料，只是临时据点，但毕竟得到了灵印士。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0406.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "63b4d44e5dc798483401ffb1dd5c50fbabcb85acf707bc372c4f24271fcce4e5",
    "target": "只是，没抓住萝洁，令人遗憾。另外……你说要让菲莉西亚加入第7组，没问题吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0406.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "d8449b58d26d84e744d26a4fc21bd52901204cefaebc180975fd987b7e11e37c",
    "target": "比起那两个天天吵架的家伙，留个安静听命的人，要好得多。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0406.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "341794751f959834ae410e863e5a7e2d1cea71525be69352ba8c0a3f0267ac7e",
    "target": "而且，乔克也希望如此，没什么问题吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0406.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "13513367944d96747455af045d7ff32389dc73678994b59b2bb42404e6a4d0a5",
    "target": "这次确实为了解决事情，暂时与乔克联手。但他终究，是斯卡拉姆修的首领。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0406.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "076814ce7b215ba2b25232732972a931c13a47d66f461181099f0a4592066027",
    "target": "他自己也明白，不能就这样释放他。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0406.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "210e4637c1d43032510981aead3f4796c0a213970664ac90e8ad3829b0114cae",
    "target": "当然，菲莉西亚是乔克的弱点，他惹事的可能性，不大。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0406.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
    "target": "……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0406.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855",
    "target": null,
    "state": "preserved",
    "preservation_evidence": "源空载荷保留，不编造对白。"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0408.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "2d3b15f08d25ae79ecff4fb1b6f02c61b278c036215d70c7028f4231aa0547eb",
    "target": "什么？那卡林兹从一开始，就和乔克那个家伙联手……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0408.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "2b27acea96c0d9da0c62ebd7fd69daf249d59f1c1d3272695f61a59ed5fc5fb0",
    "target": "毕竟，这是得到灵印士的机会，哥哥也没有反对的理由。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0408.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "ab23ffb20d0a723328cc2ffae43e2fb501226c6a66c9296b31b946ba9a203676",
    "target": "可连我们也瞒着，太过分了。我们又不傻，肯定也会合作。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0408.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "c39730b736a760785fbd5a0f93e40e1ceb35203d11f936c77dc268fba2026d2a",
    "target": "不过，乔克竟做到这种地步，就为了保护菲莉西亚？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0408.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "5e389d4e009638551196d804fa2236af58ecff94b18c33bbc3b4a7232f5a782e",
    "target": "本来可以直接带着她逃跑，何必演一场，被施瓦茨抓住的戏？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0408.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "e12684a97418459f093e102738d8c7f5879a1a4e20a093309b7449972719be8d",
    "target": "乔克一个人，保护不了菲莉西亚。她一消失，谁带走的，一目了然，贝尔米利昂怎么可能不管？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0408.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "e1c030e2cad63dbaac1847f4492bec305400dcaa26fdcc6ca4c2ba45ab1bfd34",
    "target": "那等于斯卡拉姆修，直接向贝尔米利昂宣战。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0408.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "0f68cf9021c6d4061a9b8ad80191254f415352cb022785a492e158cdb4d66cfb",
    "target": "那……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0408.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "caddcc5ae2c3e28dcedf7288abca5e92cd5d05af3e78e353358a4abc9eb1dc62",
    "target": "菲莉西亚会加入我们组吧。可乔克会怎么样，还不知道。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0408.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "79d38d35072cd57150c36bfed5ef5c24d9ac15fc730ba814ca1943efccb711a8",
    "target": "不是要关进监狱？说到底，也是斯卡拉姆修的人。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0408.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "af1c87e844d574259b3708d614d6f7659a5901d104598048ed203d9b51b6dc26",
    "target": "不好说。这次能找到菲莉西亚，全靠乔克的功劳。不过，说是功劳，也有点……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "c8dd629bfbec06d299eacebd8b6d5e6d4543ccbe6e4437272641ab961f1e71c9",
    "target": "辛苦了，成功救出了泽恩德组长。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "730df60ebe69d6a5907740fc28d441fc0b0ae8a8329375c23071c10311a7c107",
    "target": "只是泽恩德组长已经收拾过那家伙，我们处理起来，很容易。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "4cbd345af7cd09afecd81ab3289730c410eef68d51b3c91cfa9a7c037efe514a",
    "target": "你的说话方式，真是……如果上司不够宽容，早就被开除了。不过，你的实力，我已经了解。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "2ea95710c7f7e52d5e61dc1fd8a5cb74232427307456a4ef0004dd995e82fb3c",
    "target": "不满意的话，随时开除我就是。我对施瓦茨，毫不留恋。先告辞了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "2b44cf116a7caf1bf1c74d7eb016a0c1f3797446dcf64d50d69add8822e50ec7",
    "target": "果然，像匹难以驾驭的野马。似乎在吉拉特近卫队，也闹过一阵。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "84e77c297c15ecab4b6147c79b72ae4e88e33800751145e6fd639ef63b9151db",
    "target": "确实，很擅长慢慢把人惹火。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "0cce8af4c211e7f3b75d22ccb9477ebb1df023959f8d5d566de43a84649ffd90",
    "target": "所以，你才有兴趣吧。不过，还是太突然。竟然要离开第2组，加入第7组。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "50475833e1af03f35a095c4fb9c196656526a86a63cee20490ecedb0a8957c0e",
    "target": "我从一开始，就难以和第2组的人相处。即使是贵族，他们也不会好好看待身为养女的我。而且，第2组全是资历很深的人，我这个新人，也不能太出头……所以，反倒觉得第7组更适合我。至少，不用顾及体面，也有足够的空间，让我自由活动。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "8c75dee3cc01d09cd29ca3b39b2609f372521ab1cabd15849bafd71f621b61eb",
    "target": "所以，反倒觉得第7组更适合我。至少，不用顾及体面，也有足够的空间，让我自由活动。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "f5461d41feeae02c2a7ebf0271c30a25b56243e903ceb6dedef16a30422e12ea",
    "target": "……不会后悔吧？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:10:10",
    "source_sha256": "cc9b160ebd4d4aa060e335300c5a9e6fb516bc4a3c71bef767d08d1d4d708818",
    "target": "当然。而且，我对那个卡林兹有了兴趣。嘴上抱怨，心里似乎有些不同。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:11:11",
    "source_sha256": "5368ab75247f1f82d173c5c40f5cf698801327607d88772fb9e8f5b4e091fc34",
    "target": "手臂都伤了。那种怪物，明明可以交给我们。嘴上总挖苦人，可心里……总之，是个奇怪的人。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0417.fpb:text:12:12",
    "source_sha256": "194d87d1e4e54c89f0f268ee575aca0e37486196970e229c57f6e6cf09a37261",
    "target": "……？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0419.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "16e24905a91b2aea4be75dbcca14e8c42889ed81c10e78920124d77335f71e7f",
    "target": null,
    "state": "preserved",
    "preservation_evidence": "源测试记录为符号或混合随机字母与姓名/字母表；运行用途未确认，保留原字节且不计为译文。"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0419.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "f9e315be1360a5661e05166c9134ed028aa39ac86fdc25cc9000c10ebe8547f9",
    "target": null,
    "state": "preserved",
    "preservation_evidence": "仅含数字的源测试字段；用途未确认，保留字节且不计为翻译。"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0419.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "eec90c88fb1a0dde062279ef9bbf385e31815344f685ac339a7decb4e71f06b6",
    "target": "侵犯了三名女子……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0419.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "cd05d40c5f6507db5c067e0e984d1b79c6cbe03049125d73a0a6e858039d65e1",
    "target": "请选择……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0419.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "e2a0a7c88de9e47786959ee1047a212a01b04d0cabdcf3a97fff512768493a06",
    "target": "菜单1",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0419.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "aff46da90052b76cae0a898d2a125c534e99c572f2cad576b4a0ef07758ed348",
    "target": "菜单2",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0419.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "4713e02d75514180e7d48bf0e407ac32ec4305af218c057f39a16447bdd3c982",
    "target": "您好。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0419.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "3ad1d633b79e2fa3a1bafc5a5e2c1e540f90c32d8cb0fc65abfed676ea1b876a",
    "target": "辛苦了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0419.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "230a263671fd1a6bffa2fdfff9bdfb3ed284a2c582d03292d546d4d53c0dc8cd",
    "target": "再见。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0429.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "87b80617c95ea194bdb25d215062d55e8d6c08315e654fec72d0b14d92e69178",
    "target": "加入施瓦茨，也有一段时间了。现在，适应些了吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0429.fpb:text:1:1",
    "source_sha256": "212deb50cff223ddfabeaf87fcd87d8a609b6a56946e5a4fedfdf63e2c565847",
    "target": "算是吧，最近没任务，正准备偷懒。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0429.fpb:text:2:2",
    "source_sha256": "20dc7ee3295740e369eadd14157e4c6a23df53b6ea062c567e8fb96532f8d33a",
    "target": "那正好。新发现了一处遗迹，里面当然有妖石。幸好，贝尔米利昂似乎还没在那里进行灵印。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0429.fpb:text:3:3",
    "source_sha256": "4e8a367cbabd55c3990157a624fb85870c8b95e189391c6513ffc487a985e351",
    "target": "但不知道，他们什么时候会动手。尽快开始净化吧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0429.fpb:text:4:4",
    "source_sha256": "3a9f597ad0d267164acba98e4d093149a489f3320e899fbfb1c7ea5e4ada8d84",
    "target": "明白。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0429.fpb:text:5:5",
    "source_sha256": "4a3e3b31c658732e8e001a307e08afc5a2874360730db22d4230ef83b0900429",
    "target": "最近，脸色似乎不太好。有好好睡觉吗？",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0429.fpb:text:6:6",
    "source_sha256": "af66e018a0cfebcd56737a9fa089f3626077ed14e0425c95df837c3dc76430c6",
    "target": "保持身体健康，也是任务之一。真正需要时派不上用场，就麻烦了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0429.fpb:text:7:7",
    "source_sha256": "3f76881eb1697e77f64bfd51500122e73567ae9282bd8be0657f8b4616fc9315",
    "target": "唉……我知道。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0429.fpb:text:8:8",
    "source_sha256": "e0e4c5cdb29a877d5e1e9573b1cf593fa9281b79ac96f78e85a42983570ddfc1",
    "target": "总队长说得没错。最近任务不多，明明比平时睡得更足，却不知为何很疲惫。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0429.fpb:text:9:9",
    "source_sha256": "6eb9046560f1fe4e29c6e2a64ca69e51f2a0ee2a086ac3b8a266f5bd343042eb",
    "target": "而且，有时半夜醒来，觉得身体已经冷透，就像刚吹过冷风……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0443.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "1b5f3cb60f616bc9e69b0c6534083e684d54c325149b76550387104fb8ad2da8",
