    "target": "斯卡拉姆修地下城入口",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0449.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "e03b25dde787fcb69fda19f0ba9fbd4740c06d36b292f99ba0f0a032a42eb754",
    "target": "斯卡拉姆修地下城南部",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0450.fpb:text:0:0",
    "source_sha256": "f4faab15d64899f8620f57b5a1984a3cb6ba787320848aea7cd002d3d257b142",
    "target": "斯卡拉姆修地下城中心·连接通道",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:0:13",
    "source_sha256": "b2b898cd470af9acc3698a8e14859e1e9ceeaa5b3cfd4f3b0f692210f1276513",
    "target": "好久不见，朱克蕾西亚。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:1:14",
    "source_sha256": "c2167352f93f975d4196e18573e406412ddec1013ef24a74960257f6aa15c730",
    "target": "很高兴，你再次回宫。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:2:0",
    "source_sha256": "805c9bd635548a41cf26c586c9c60649487fd0e50c54687f84f895d3ea56d4a9",
    "target": "好久不见，太后殿下。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:3:1",
    "source_sha256": "f53e9718a2b3585e22d331659fead1517491c74971f480ab7d7367154e657343",
    "target": "变得如此美丽，几乎认不出了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:4:2",
    "source_sha256": "1cedca68a163d3ad2fd0f5a8e01292dd3a23eb2db4345b4d11dd02a81ea472e5",
    "target": "多亏您的关心。久别归乡，本来有些担心，但大家都热情欢迎，让我安心了。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:5:3",
    "source_sha256": "597e2a7c68a544398f7a34bceeaa3e7d8314c33e38b35db29402bb7342e72ef5",
    "target": "呵呵，是吗。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:6:4",
    "source_sha256": "e41298a574a8d05ade35da6dafe9ac00cea954ed20d057d6eaf5c82de8cdd9d7",
    "target": "没必要刻意装出笑容吧，太后殿下。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:7:5",
    "source_sha256": "fc742869cb5d5a08357ee08ff20100ad518b673140562e99948092eb4f252f16",
    "target": "先帝一直很想念唯一的女儿，却过早驾崩……我也很遗憾。葬礼时也想召你回来，但碍于先帝的旨意……",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:8:6",
    "source_sha256": "98e9023470b35dfbc216b25df28c52b0460bcb5993116f2247f1303ae0bbba8e",
    "target": "够了。那件事……如今，我也想安静地埋在心里。虽被父亲赶走，但唯一的弟弟，将我这样重新召回，已经足够。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:9:7",
    "source_sha256": "49d4f7951332ee390e70a001d565eeab23c2c8044f27407698287e77f768288c",
    "target": "好。今天也经历了大事，什么都别想，好好休息吧。我已为防万一，加强了警卫，不必担忧。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:10:8",
    "source_sha256": "7573667a863c4570fdee696103a1626525ebf2d2793ffcebdf209f0ca56f6448",
    "target": "谢谢您的关心，殿下。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:11:9",
    "source_sha256": "c9a1408e6d65d92b90b6246064c8d9a519b58b75e10f110f2365906907a7a2b1",
    "target": "我……和朱克蕾西亚的母亲，关系很好。通常，后宫新人入宫，总会彼此嫉妒，可像她那样美丽、亲切的人，还是第一次见。我也多亏她，才能熬过艰难的宫廷生活。她为什么必须那样死去……真的令人心痛。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:12:10",
    "source_sha256": "3ba9b6265e83212d02779a1c8619f56687033acce4d70705239183d0ec1832f2",
    "target": "……没有嫉妒？母亲明明是因为你，才死的！总有一天，我会揭下你的假面。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:13:11",
    "source_sha256": "f1a5299f7cb2071f6f1c4be2442e7bc85afd7ecd662cb42da3334f4e453c9af8",
    "target": "说了些没用的话。休息吧，朱克蕾西亚。",
    "state": "translated"
  },
  {
    "id": "Fpb/0455.fpb:text:14:12",
    "source_sha256": "f6e9488d466107f96bcaa6c953e09f5e88f373625656838ed0b7da280d740d63",
    "target": "不会再像十年前那样，毫无反抗地任人摆布。不明就里，只会害怕，被赶出皇宫的我，已经不在了。失去多少……我就要取回多少，太后殿下。",
    "state": "translated"
  }
]
